1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,740
I used to fight back every tear, bury it where none could see

2
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:12,580
Thought that crying made me weaker than a man was meant to be

3
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:18,900
Now when I need to, I just cry, and I let it have its say

4
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:25,300
I'm only human, nothing more, and it's human to feel that way

5
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:28,340
Beat the drum and sing it out

6
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:31,540
That's what living's all about

7
00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:37,060
Live now, die later

8
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:40,100
Let the laughter ring

9
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:43,060
Live now, die later

10
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:45,620
Let the tears fall too

11
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:50,020
Both the masks are part of living

12
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:52,580
Both of them are true

13
00:00:52,580 --> 00:00:55,780
Live now, die later

14
00:00:55,780 --> 00:00:59,220
Feel the whole thing through
